==== hyperbricks yaml {!{plugin}} ====
plugin:
  - type: plugin
  - enclose: <div>|</div>
  - plugin: example
==== explainer ====
Wrap rendered output using prefix|suffix syntax
==== expected json ====
{
  "Classes": null,
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<PLUGIN>",
  "Data": null,
  "Enclose": "<div>|</div>",
  "ExtraAttributes": null,
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "PluginName": "example"
}

==== expected output ====
<div>Plugin example</div>
